    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889040/extras/755c8e973264c7b1d522901f35020c83.avif?t=1739362118\" /></div><br><br>Birth is an adventure game about constructing a creature from spare bones &amp; organs found around the city in order to quell your loneliness. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect bones &amp; organs in hand-drawn museums, coffee shops, alleys, flower shops, libraries, markets, bakeries and more.<br></li><li>Solve physics-based puzzles &amp; interact with unique, interesting creatures.<br></li><li>Find &amp; spend hidden tokens to discover secrets.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889040/extras/d31210ddf39b0006ab0871da212b4313.poster.avif?t=1739362118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889040/extras/d31210ddf39b0006ab0871da212b4313.webm?t=1739362118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889040/extras/d31210ddf39b0006ab0871da212b4313.mp4?t=1739362118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889040/extras/755c8e973264c7b1d522901f35020c83.avif?t=1739362118\" /></div><br><br>Birth is an adventure game about constructing a creature from spare bones &amp; organs found around the city in order to quell your loneliness. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect bones &amp; organs in hand-drawn museums, coffee shops, alleys, flower shops, libraries, markets, bakeries and more.<br></li><li>Solve physics-based puzzles &amp; interact with unique, interesting creatures.<br></li><li>Find &amp; spend hidden tokens to discover secrets.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889040/extras/d31210ddf39b0006ab0871da212b4313.poster.avif?t=1739362118\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889040/extras/d31210ddf39b0006ab0871da212b4313.webm?t=1739362118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1889040/extras/d31210ddf39b0006ab0871da212b4313.mp4?t=1739362118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "You are alone. You will build a creature, a partner, a wet warm heart, a collection of bones.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe distinctive, creepy-yet-beautiful art style really sets it apart from just about everything in gaming today.\u201d<br>Kotaku<br><br>\u201cBirth is like if plague doctors and 2004 web series Salad Fingers were beautiful instead of deeply upsetting.\u201d<br>IGN<br><br>\u201cNo matter what my eyes turned to and my fingers clicked on, each puzzle and environment only ever ended in a sense of triumph and discovery.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>",
